  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "为了度量面积用下列面积单位：平方毫米、平方厘米、平方分米、平方米、平方公里。例如：1平方米就是边长1米的正方形的面积。上面提到的面积单位表示成：$\\mathrm{mm}^2$，$\\mathrm{cm}^2$，$\\mathrm{dm}^2$，$\\mathrm{m}^2$，$\\mathrm{km}^2$。我们知道，$1\\mathrm{dm}^2$包含$100\\mathrm{cm}^2$。也就是$1\\mathrm{cm}^2$等于$\\frac1{100}\\mathrm{dm}^2$：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 65,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0074#10",
        "p0075#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$1\\mathrm{dm}^2=100\\mathrm{cm}^2$，$1\\mathrm{cm}^2=\\frac1{100}\\mathrm{dm}^2$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 66,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0075#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "土地的面积用公顷（ha）度量。1公顷（ha）就是边长100米的正方形的面积。1公顷包含$10\\,000\\mathrm{m}^2$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 66,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0075#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "小块的土地用公亩度量。1公亩（1a）就是边长10m的正方形的面积。也就是1公亩包含$100\\mathrm{m}^2$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 66,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0075#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$1\\mathrm{ha}=100\\mathrm{a}=10\\,000\\mathrm{m}^2$，$1\\mathrm{a}=100\\mathrm{m}^2$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 66,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0075#5"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
